+## Ordinary local Garage newspaper stories override (2026-10-16)
+The owner requests example stories and clarifies that they should appear like normal stories. An empty/unavailable Headlines feed now shows five local stories in the regular newspaper, with dates, car photographs and two packaged96-point native track outlines. Keep the normal edition, navigation and Friends tab; no separate example tab/badge. Real available account news replaces the local stories automatically. Local stories never enter account news/friend caches, records or API payloads; browsing adds no reads, jobs, live renders or writes. Focused29/native112+112/parser830 pass. Actual captures, commands and task-only patch: `docs/GARAGE_NEWS_LOCAL_STORIES_2026_10_16.md`. Owner/phone appearance acceptance remains; no phone check/test, APK, backend change or deployment.
+
 ## Forgiving driving-button touch targets override (2026-10-16)
 The owner reports missed presses slightly outside driving buttons and requests larger hit areas wherever no other button is present. Saved layouts now gain56 logical units horizontally/64 above/72 below, bounded by safe driving space. Original button faces win; shared empty margins choose the nearest original face with one deterministic action. Keep five cached candidates, actual artwork/layout, analog origins, separate handbrake and canonical inputs/physics. Any press inside an expanded digital pedal target is full strength; captured pedals cannot activate neighbours, while left/right slides reverse in the same event. Focused1162headless/1166Compatibility/1166Mobile, existing buttons747/analog1642/layout407 including viewport90 pass. Native captures, initial rectangular-clipping correction and one unreproduced native-fixture failure are retained with actual commands/task-only patch in `docs/evidence/touch-target-padding-2026-10-16/report.json`. Owner/physical-phone feel acceptance remains; no phone check/test, APK or deployment for this change.
 
